      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With them now adding more performance options (avatar hider and FSR), I really hope they fix this soon. \nIt's really annoying to need to change this setting every other time I start the game. \nThis has been an issue since the Unity 2019 update, so day 1 of it being an in-game setting. I'm not even sure why it happens every other restart, the game clearly must save and read the setting correctly, but why does it fail the next time it reads it and then defaults it to Ultra? The MSAA setting works perfectly fine, so I'm at a loss.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
